  "notes": "Cash basis county. Statement receipts/disbursements from the Total Governmental Funds column (p4). Statement 'Taxes' 2,478,276 split using the Statement of Activities general receipts (p2): Property 2,100,341 + Motor vehicle 362,382 + Lodging tax 15,553 = 2,478,276 exactly. 'Local' 593,344 kept as one line (context label; SoA charges 461,525 + interest 109,207 + misc 20,295 = 591,027, does not tie). Fund balances (beginning 6,661,188 / ending 5,884,690) recorded as fund balance; cash (Cash 4,240,752 + Restricted cash 1,643,938) is on the balance sheet only, no beginning cash printed. Balance sheet from the governmental funds Statement of Assets and Fund Balances (p3), whose totals equal the Statement of Net Position (p1, 5,884,690). Detail: General Fund budget schedule (p8, by department; Taxes split into property and motor vehicle by subtraction, budget not split; it supersedes the General Fund column of the combining statement p5), Inheritance Tax Fund column from the General Fund combining statement (p5), Road Fund and ARPA budget schedules (p9-10, single 'Disbursements' lines), and the nonmajor combining statement per fund (9 funds, p6-7). Transfers: fund-level in 320,470 = out 320,470 (General 88,061 in / 22,541 out, Inheritance 252,184 out, Road 213,020 in, ARPA 7,581 in, nonmajor 11,808 in / 45,745 out); the statement p4 shows 258,424 after netting transfers within the General Fund (Inheritance -> General 52,181) and within nonmajor funds (911 Wireless -> 911 Holding 9,865). Read pages 1-10 of 10"
